Because you always, you realize your own limitations.

c0692
00:49:20.720 --> 00:49:31.720
You know how frail the human mind is. You make an error. You do not overestimate yourself.

c0693
00:49:31.720 --> 00:49:41.720
There are people, there are most intelligent people out of the world. Take a scientist, a great scientist.

c0694
