We told that we were, ah, in the way of the Jewish.

c0742
00:52:01.960 --> 00:52:03.080
And that's not good.

c0743
00:52:03.160 --> 00:52:05.740
They were really good in the way of the Jewish.

c0744
00:52:06.260 --> 00:52:07.780
So this is what our father says.

c0745
00:52:08.000 --> 00:52:11.860
The worst thing is, go back there.

c0746
00:52:12.520 --> 00:52:13.760
We got to go on this.

