And that's why Moshé Rabbeinu says,

c0748
00:52:20.940 --> 00:52:22.780
This was Anab.

c0749
00:52:25.880 --> 00:52:27.480
Anab Me'or.

c0750
00:52:27.500 --> 00:52:42.500
And this you could go in extreme. Because in relationship with God, no matter how much you minimize yourself, still you are too much. You understand? Yes.

c0751
00:52:42.500 --> 00:52:47.740
You said earlier that sometimes when you're too humble, it's bad for you.

c0752
00:52:47.740 --> 00:52:52.540
Look, I don't want to say to you that you'll get yourself a statue.

c0753
