Your Anab is being a good lawyer. He says, no, I made a mistake. I did it twice. Because why? Your Anab, you're on the front table. Why? Because your Anab, Anab is a person who is not overconfident, overfearing himself. I cannot make a mistake. Oh, I cannot have a significant.

c0757
00:53:28.500 --> 00:53:35.500
Why should I go to the doctor, waste my time to go to have a checkup once a year?

c0758
00:53:35.500 --> 00:53:37.500
I'm Superman.

